{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"该接口适用于升级版巨量引擎工作台的资产共享，资产类型包括商品库、应用、小程序小游戏、事件资产等，可进行指定账户id共享、主体下所有账户共享、组织下所有账户共享等操作。关键配合接口有【获取Access token】。\",\"id\":\"tools.ebp_asset.auth\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/tools/ebp/asset/auth/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1848327327721671\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求该接口需要通过此接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1848327327721671\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"添加资产共享\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-upS5pjg3\">适用场景：（升级版工作台资产共享能力介绍参考<a href=\"https://support.oceanengine.com/support/content/145109?spaceId=377&amp;mappingType=2\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">帮助中心</a>）</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-KVi6HW04\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bYmWZgTQ\">资产归属：归属升级版巨量引擎工作台的资产</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2wlhweykijg000\">资产类型：商品库、应用、小程序小游戏、事件资产</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FXn789Ml\">功能：操作维度为某个升级版组织下的资产</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-MZ1Kc6g7\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GPMUhsi8\">指定账户id共享：包含ad、千川、本地推、星图、企业号、普通版组织、升级版组织</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uEqpeCu1\">主体下所有账户共享</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4zmBwe2n\">组织下所有账户共享：包含普通版组织及升级版组织</li></ul><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1841601008791680%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22iEpkF%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-eRTVXxv2\" id=\"h346b9f0-eRTVXxv2\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-FZIi62BX\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/tools/ebp/asset/auth/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1848327327721671\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-RD6zd9b4\" id=\"h346b9f0-RD6zd9b4\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-qwqlmliX\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-x1gulhhK\" id=\"h346b9f0-x1gulhhK\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-q4H82WXy\" id=\"h346b9f0-q4H82WXy\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CQLDARMo\">账户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-G3SWlLh8\">账户类型，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-ygXOx2pp\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-X1i7bB4M\"><code>EBP</code> 企业版组织</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">auth_targets</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Z6OvbSV5\">共享信息</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-0qv0K2OT\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-L08oYQS1\">指定账户ID共享，上限100个ID</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-aHococvu\">组织下所有账户共享，上限20个ID</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">auth_target_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-sjmLyEij\">共享模式，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-YOsKmp2k\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-FzweG9kh\"><code>ACCOUNT</code> 共享给账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jdMoT3RS\"><code>COMPANY_ALL_ACCOUNT</code> 共享给主体下所有账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KTFKVMTV\"><code>COMPANY_APPKEY_ACCOUNT</code> 共享给主体下某条业务线下的账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0rr8hLeG\"><code>GROUP_ALL_ACCOUNT</code> 共享给组织下所有账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3BlLb0lq\"><code>GROUP_APPKEY_ACCOUNT</code> 授权给组织下某条业务线下的账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-xTJBOwJS\"><code>GROUP_DIRECT_ACCOUNT</code> 共享给升级版组织全部账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-P9d4G4qM\"><code>GROUP_OVERALL_ACCOUNT</code> 共享给升级版组织及下属组织全部账户</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">target_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-iG38jDX3\">共享目标账户ID</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-XNDC9Imj\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-T6l32Qb0\">指定账户共享：账户ID</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-nPkIQ0WD\">组织下所有账户共享：普通版组织ID或升级版组织ID</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">sub_target</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\">业务线类型，允许值：<br/><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-OA6G7GYm\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-g2xmmdRY\"><code>AD</code> 巨量营销</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qOAWW9yR\"><code>QIANCHUAN</code> 巨量千川</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5g50zEkn\"><code>LOCAL</code> 巨量本地推</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">assets</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4637y3gqrqw000\">授权资产范围，上限20个</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"> 可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-dwb4ncoea4o00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-8tma7am49ow00\"><code>APP</code> 应用</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-9d0k5t4x8v800\"><code>APPLETS</code> 小程序</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-igyxzajzq5k00\"><code>BYTED_APPLETS</code> 字节小程序</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-261nybua8cow0\"><code>BYTED_GAME</code> 字节小游戏</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-56vpqkj1elw00\"><code>DPA</code> 通用版商品库</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-bzpc8rsanvk00\"><code>HARMONY_APP</code> 鸿蒙应用</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-gus4sk94ta000\"><code>PRODUCT</code> 升级版商品</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-hsojj3l212o00\"><code>QUICK_APP</code> 快应用</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-43dgul9736g00\"><code>WECHAT_GAME</code> 小游戏</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-5op8gietyv4000\"><code>EVENT_MANAGER</code> 事件资产</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_scope_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">共享资产范围类型，指定具体资产进行共享或将升级版工作台下某个团队所有资产打包共享，可选值: <br/><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-3w8hswrardw000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-j5wn59ypssw00\"><code>GroupDirectAsset</code> 组织直连资产</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-f55fs02tkn400\"><code>GroupOverallAsset</code> 组织及子组织全部资产</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3near7juuds00\"><code>SingleAsset</code> 单个资产</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4cna17bsjhu000\">注意：事件资产仅支持<code>SingleAsset</code>的共享模式</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_scope</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-a4td4i6wijk00\">共享资产范围，随asset_scope_type不同类型，需要传入资产id或升级版组织id</p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-3rl9scu91xw000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2ejwquq6miqs00\">指定资产id操作共享：传具体资产ID</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-fl36h1p9m1400\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-4m99p71gghs000\">通用版商品库需要传dpa_id</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-17xczomzq4sg00\">事件资产传事件资产id</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-37gmb9wwuew000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2kwlflrmamw