ss=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 36px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_scope</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-O4PHnZuo\">共享的资产范围 (单个资产、组织直属资产、组织及下属组织资产)</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HA7evZTx\">资产类型</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-3JPHFp8L\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9Gng3JO1\"><code>APPLETS</code> 微信小程序</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6EOG8gYi\"><code>BYTED_APPLETS</code> 字节小程序</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3i8uWWTu\"><code>BYTED_GAME</code> 字节小游戏</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-unT5UKmO\"><code>DPA</code> 通用版商品库</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6BQI8g03\"><code>PRODUCT</code> 升级版商品</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-yGNvRWFY\"><code>WECHAT_GAME</code> 微信小游戏</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-3939ts5dzn6000\"><code>APP</code> 应用</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-392fqz1df4g000\"><code>HARMONY_APP</code> 鸿蒙</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1gn7qz7gw1b400\"><code>QUICK_APP</code> 快应用</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-sy8oainfx5s00\"><code>EVENT_MANAGER</code> 事件资产</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_scope</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-wSTeKoWC\">共享资产范围</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-gwYEfBaR\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cT3nRPYp\">指定资产id操作共享：具体资产ID</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u2ynadd4g-5o4fatrkysg000\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-230emsnzud7k00\">通用版商品库为dpa_id</li><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-13ttlhb0ywo000\">事件资产为事件资产id</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-2qj5hlloqts000\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-9b2gj1idn3800\">团队或包含下级团队资产操作共享：资产所在团队id</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">asset_scope_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PuSwEQpu\">资产范围类型，枚举值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-ZoV9D3MA\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-xeP4nY9h\"><code>GROUP_DIRECT_ASSET</code> 组织直连资产</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tmwtamMJ\"><code>GROUP_OVERALL_ASSET</code> 组织及子组织全部资产</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7tuCdtYJ\"><code>SINGLE_ASSET</code> 单个资产</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 36px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">auth_target</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Hq0BCQGu\">共享账户范围</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">auth_target_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-B5uLoMQZ\">共享模式，枚举值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-kUBHNOW0\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dwlJNCvN\"><code>ACCOUNT</code> 共享给账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-jDF3xU0n\"><code>COMPANY_ALL_ACCOUNT</code> 共享给主体下所有账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8uGIfKjO\"><code>COMPANY_APPKEY_ACCOUNT</code> 共享给主体下某条业务线下的账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-ue96PoQK\"><code>GROUP_ALL_ACCOUNT</code> 共享给组织下所有账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NZtpvNGm\"><code>GROUP_APPKEY_ACCOUNT</code> 授权给组织下某条业务线下的账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-amghtrRW\"><code>GROUP_DIRECT_ACCOUNT</code> 共享给升级版组织全部账户</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QuFyNvgO\"><code>GROUP_OVERALL_ACCOUNT</code> 共享给升级版组织及下属组织全部账户</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">target_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rPTAMYbU\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">共享目标账户ID</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">target_name</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-RaSNgDiy\">共享目标账户名称</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">depth</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8qxphngV\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">升级版组织层级，根节点=0</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">is_default_auth</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ujrOjKYq\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">true代表为默认授权，不可取消</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_depth</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Z40ahpR6\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">共享发起方在升级版组织中的层级，根节点=0</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">request_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求日志id</section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-NhVlDpBZ\" id=\"h346b9f0-NhVlDpBZ\">应答示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22disabled%22%3Atrue%2C%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22HTTPS%2F1.1%20200%20OK%5Cn%7B%